    {
      "text": "CellRank 的 lineage fate probability 与基因表达的相关性只能说明这些基因与谱系命运概率存在统计关联，不能证明它们是驱动谱系分化的因果基因。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在没有独立干预实验（independent_intervention=none）的情况下，将这类基因称为“candidate driver genes”是过强的因果表述，证据强度不足以支持“driver”这一因果含义。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:independent_intervention"]
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞应保留相关性与候选性，并明确排除因果驱动含义，例如：“These are lineage-correlated candidate genes, not validated driver genes.”",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
